coding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Immortality_Lessons\" title=\"Immortality Lessons\">Immortality Lessons</a></b>, End chest, 'Granny' Optional Chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Crown_of_Summer\" title=\"Crown of Summer\">Crown of Summer</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Crown_of_Summer\" title=\"Crown of Summer\">Crown of Summer</a>:</b> You permanently benefit from Crown of Summer.<br />Crown of Summer: You have a +15 Positive <a href=\"/page/Healing_Amplification\" title=\"Healing Amplification\">Healing Amplification</a>, and you gain 10 <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee Power</a> and 5 <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged Power</a> (all <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a>).</span></span></li>\n<li><span cl