Pieces Equipped: +1 Artifact bonus to all spell DCs</li><li>7 Pieces Equipped: +5 Artifact bonus to Physical and Magical Resistance Rating</li></ul></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Head Boost</a> +1 or +3<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Head Boost</a> +1 or +3:</b> +1 or +3 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Crown_of_Butterflies.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Crown_of_Butterflies.png/420px-Crown_of_Butterflies.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"594\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Crown_of_Butterflies.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>Delightful butterflies flutter around your head.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<p>Cosmetic version of this crown (created using the <a href=\"/page/Item:Mirror_of_Glamering\" title=\"Item:Mirror of Glamering\">Mirror of Glamering</a>) shows the butterflies along with the currently equipped helmet.<sup>(<span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forums.ddo.com/index.php?threads/980\">DDO Forums</a></span>)</sup>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817152308\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.094 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.136 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4252/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32398/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10996/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n112.72%  131.897     57 Template:IO\n100.00%  117.016      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  117.016      1 -total\n 97.46%  114.038      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 37.01%   43.311      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 36.33%   42.512      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 35.57%   41.620      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 34.75%   40.658      2 Template:InCategory\n 23.93%   28.002      9 Template:Popup\n 15.11%   17.682      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:84053-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817152308 and revision id 689539. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
